### Listar todas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications

### Crear una candidatura
POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Accenture",
  "position": "Backend Developer Junior",
  "status": "SAVED",
  "location": "Madrid",
  "workMode": "REMOTE",
  "salaryMin": 24000,
  "salaryMax": 30000,
  "offerUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/123456789",
  "source": "LinkedIn",
  "appliedAt": "2026-08-21"
}

### Ver una por id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1

### Ver una que no existe
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications/999

### Sin company
POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "position": "Backend Developer Junior",
  "status": "SAVED",
  "location": "Madrid",
  "workMode": "REMOTE",
  "salaryMin": 24000,
  "salaryMax": 30000,
  "offerUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/123456789",
  "source": "LinkedIn",
  "appliedAt": "2026-08-21"
}

### Salario negativo
POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Accenture",
  "position": "Backend Developer Junior",
  "status": "SAVED",
  "location": "Madrid",
  "workMode": "REMOTE",
  "salaryMin": -24000,
  "salaryMax": -30000,
  "offerUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/123456789",
  "source": "LinkedIn",
  "appliedAt": "2026-08-21"
}

### Put
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Indra",
  "position": "Backend Developer Junior",
  "status": "SA",
  "location": "Madrid",
  "workMode": "REMOTE",
  "salaryMin": 24000,
  "salaryMax": 30000,
  "offerUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/123456789",
  "source": "LinkedIn",
  "appliedAt": "2026-08-21"
}

### Delete borrar uno
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/applications/3